WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.282 --> 00:00:11.251
&gt;&gt; AFTER MORE THAN A CENTURY OF

00:00:10.084 --> 00:00:13.554
TEACHING MILLIONS OF AMERICAN

00:00:11.385 --> 00:00:15.489
BOYS MARKMANSHIP, WOOD CRAFTS,

00:00:13.687 --> 00:00:17.424
PATRIOTISM, GOOD CITIZENSHIP,

00:00:15.622 --> 00:00:19.293
THE BOY SCOUTS OF AMERICA HAVE

00:00:17.558 --> 00:00:20.994
DECIDED TO CHANGE COMPLETELY,

00:00:19.426 --> 00:00:26.934
STARTING WITH THEIR NAME.

00:00:21.128 --> 00:00:27.868
IT'S NOW THE SCOUTS, GENDER

00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:29.570
NEUTRAL.

00:00:29.703 --> 00:00:32.473
NUMBER ONE SHOW, CALLED

00:00:31.004 --> 00:00:34.708
"RETURNING THE FAVOR."

00:00:32.606 --> 00:00:36.677
WE SPOKE TO HIM RECENTLY.

00:00:34.842 --> 00:00:38.812
THANKS A LOT FOR JOINING US.

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:39.613
YOU WERE FAMOUSLY AN EAGLE SCOUT

00:00:38.946 --> 00:00:41.248
AS A BOY.

00:00:39.746 --> 00:00:43.150
THE SCOUTS ARE NO LONGER THE BOY

00:00:41.381 --> 00:00:44.518
SCOUTS BUT SIMPLY THE SCOUTS.

00:00:43.283 --> 00:00:47.054
WHAT'S YOUR RESPONSE TO THAT?

00:00:44.651 --> 00:00:48.789
&gt;&gt; WELL, IT'S FUNNY UNDER ASK,

00:00:47.187 --> 00:00:50.090
BECAUSE NO LESS THAN 10,000

00:00:48.922 --> 00:00:51.091
PEOPLE HAVE ASKED ME THAT VERY

00:00:50.224 --> 00:00:52.259
QUESTION OVER THE LAST MONTH.

00:00:51.225 --> 00:00:55.362
&gt;&gt; I BET.

00:00:52.392 --> 00:00:56.663
&gt;&gt; ON MY FACEBOOK PAGE,

00:00:55.496 --> 00:00:58.165
DISTINGUISHED EAGLE SCOUT, IF

00:00:56.797 --> 00:01:01.101
YOU'RE KEEPING SCORE, FIVE OR

00:00:58.298 --> 00:01:01.401
SIX YEARS AGO I WAS AWARDED

00:01:01.235 --> 00:01:02.369
THAT.

00:01:01.535 --> 00:01:03.971
IT WAS VERY TOUCHING.

00:01:02.503 --> 00:01:07.875
LOOK, I'M WATCHING WHAT'S

00:01:04.104 --> 00:01:10.444
HAPPENING CAREFULLY.

00:01:08.008 --> 00:01:12.513
I'VE SENT 50,000 TO 55,000

00:01:10.577 --> 00:01:14.148
LETTERS OUT OVER THE LAST 10

00:01:12.646 --> 00:01:15.749
YEARS TO OTHER EAGLE SCOUTS.

00:01:14.281 --> 00:01:16.083
I THINK THE COUNTRY NEEDS THE

00:01:15.883 --> 00:01:17.451
SCOUTS.

00:01:16.216 --> 00:01:21.388
I THINK THE COUNTRY NEEDS THE

00:01:18.085 --> 00:01:24.825
FUTURE FARMERS OF AMERICA AND

00:01:21.522 --> 00:01:25.392
SKILLS USA AND 4-H, DESPERATELY,

00:01:24.958 --> 00:01:28.028
NOW MORE THAN EVER.

00:01:25.526 --> 00:01:30.931
IT CONCERNS ME TO SEE ALL THE

00:01:28.162 --> 00:01:34.168
CONFUSION SWIRLING AROUND THE

00:01:31.064 --> 00:01:36.603
ORGANIZATION, BUT LIKE SO MANY

00:01:34.301 --> 00:01:37.671
WOUNDS I'M AFRAID SO MANY OF

00:01:36.737 --> 00:01:39.540
THESE ARE SELF-INFLICTED.

00:01:37.804 --> 00:01:40.774
I ALSO THINK THAT SOME OF THE

00:01:39.673 --> 00:01:41.308
CONFUSION GOING ON IS

00:01:40.908 --> 00:01:43.143
LEGITIMATE.

00:01:41.441 --> 00:01:45.546
I READ THEIR OFFICIAL STATEMENT.

00:01:43.277 --> 00:01:47.848
WHILE GIRLS ARE BEING WELCOMED

00:01:45.679 --> 00:01:50.184
IN, I DIDN'T READ ANYTHING ABOUT

00:01:47.981 --> 00:01:50.717
INTEGRATED CAMPING TRIPS OR

00:01:50.317 --> 00:01:53.287
TROOP MEETINGS.

00:01:50.851 --> 00:01:54.321
I THINK IT'S A PLAY TO COMPETE

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:56.356
WITH THE GIRL SCOUTS.

00:01:54.454 --> 00:01:57.491
I UNDERSTAND WHEN THE GIRL

00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:59.326
SCOUTS ARE UPSET, BUT SINCE WHEN

00:01:57.624 --> 00:02:00.460
IS COMPETITION A BAD THING?

00:01:59.459 --> 00:02:01.862
I THINK CHARACTER DEVELOPMENT

00:02:00.594 --> 00:02:03.430
AND LEADERSHIP DEVELOPMENT HAVE

00:02:01.995 --> 00:02:04.731
NEVER BEEN MORE IMPORTANT THAN

00:02:03.664 --> 00:02:08.302
THEY ARE TODAY.

00:02:04.865 --> 00:02:09.937
SO MY HOPE IS THAT THE BOY

00:02:08.435 --> 00:02:11.705
SCOUTS ASSUME THE OPPORTUNITY

00:02:10.070 --> 00:02:15.108
THAT'S PRESENTING ITSELF, AND

00:02:11.838 --> 00:02:17.611
BECOME AN ANTIDOTE FOR THE SAFE

00:02:15.242 --> 00:02:19.413
SPACE ENVIRONMENT THAT'S OUT

00:02:17.744 --> 00:02:19.913
THERE, AND PUSH BACK A LITTLE

00:02:19.546 --> 00:02:21.148
BIT.

00:02:20.047 --> 00:02:22.716
NOT TO SOUND LIKE THE ANGRY GUY

00:02:21.281 --> 00:02:24.284
ON YOUR NEIGHBOR'S PORCH YELLING

00:02:22.849 --> 00:02:27.754
AT THE KIDS ON THE LAWN, BUT

00:02:24.418 --> 00:02:31.391
WHEN I WAS IN THE SCOUTS, IN '64

00:02:27.888 --> 00:02:32.526
AND '75, IT WASN'T A SAFE SPACE

00:02:31.525 --> 00:02:34.895
IN THE BASEMENT OF OUR CHURCH,

00:02:32.659 --> 00:02:36.330
YOU'D GO HOME WITH A BLOODY NOSE

00:02:35.062 --> 00:02:37.431
OR A BLACK EYE.

00:02:36.463 --> 00:02:40.167
WE HAD A BOXING RING.

00:02:37.564 --> 00:02:41.868
IT WAS A VIBRANT PLACE WHERE YOU

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:45.105
REALLY COULD TEST YOURSELF AND

00:02:45.239 --> 00:02:48.242
HANDMADE YOU SAFE ENOUGH TO

00:02:47.441 --> 00:02:50.143
ATTEMPT, BUT, ON THE OTHER HAND,

00:02:48.375 --> 00:02:52.779
DIDN'T TRY AND CHECK EVERY BOX

00:02:50.277 --> 00:02:54.348
AND PLEASE EVERY SINGLE PERSON.

00:02:52.913 --> 00:02:56.783
IT'S A TOUGH TIME.

00:02:55.215 --> 00:02:59.319
YOU KNOW, I'M SYMPATHETIC FOR

00:02:56.917 --> 00:03:01.021
THE LEADERS, BUT I'M AFRAID

00:02:59.453 --> 00:03:02.289
YOU'VE GOT TO DRAW THE LINE AND

00:03:01.154 --> 00:03:02.856
BE CLEAR WHAT YOU STAND FOR AS

00:03:02.422 --> 00:03:05.559
WELL AS AGAINST.

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:07.060
&gt;&gt; SO YOU DON'T SEE THIS AS THE

00:03:05.692 --> 00:03:07.861
END OF SOMETHING THEN?

00:03:07.194 --> 00:03:10.597
&gt;&gt; I DON'T KNOW.

00:03:07.995 --> 00:03:13.467
I MEAN, AGAIN, YOU EITHER EVOLVE

00:03:11.398 --> 00:03:15.502
OR YOU -- OR YOU DIE.

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:17.638
BUT AT THE SAME TIME I THINK

00:03:15.636 --> 00:03:19.339
PEOPLE ARE CONFUSED BECAUSE THE

00:03:17.771 --> 00:03:21.908
SCOUTS SIMPLY HAVEN'T COME OUT

00:03:19.473 --> 00:03:24.144
AND SAID CATEGORICALLY WHAT

00:03:22.042 --> 00:03:26.747
THEY'RE FOR, RIGHT?

00:03:24.344 --> 00:03:28.048
SO I JUST THINK THIS

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:29.549
CONVERSATION TOUCHES ON EVERY

00:03:28.181 --> 00:03:30.884
SINGLE POINT RIGHT NOW GOING ON

00:03:29.683 --> 00:03:33.920
IN POPULAR CULTURE, FROM

00:03:31.018 --> 00:03:35.589
TOLERANCE TO ACCEPTANCE, WHICH,

00:03:34.054 --> 00:03:36.623
BY THE WAY, I'M NOT SURE WHAT

00:03:35.722 --> 00:03:37.858
THE DIFFERENCE BETWEEN THOSE TWO

00:03:36.757 --> 00:03:39.393
THINGS IS ANYMORE, BUT THERE

00:03:37.991 --> 00:03:42.129
USED TO BE A BIG DIFFERENCE.

00:03:39.526 --> 00:03:42.663
PEOPLE ARE STRUGGLING FOR THEIR

00:03:42.262 --> 00:03:44.698
OWN IDENTITY.

00:03:42.796 --> 00:03:46.767
LOOK, THE LAST TIME I WAS ON, WE

00:03:44.831 --> 00:03:48.869
TALKED ABOUT THE IDEA THAT

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:53.307
EVERYTHING IS EITHER BEING

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:57.544
OR EVERYTHING IS BEING INFORMED

00:03:54.941 --> 00:03:57.944
BY PEOPLE WHO WANT TO BE

00:03:57.678 --> 00:03:59.346
CHALLENGED.

00:03:58.078 --> 00:04:00.347
I THINK PEOPLE ARE DESPERATE TO

00:03:59.479 --> 00:04:03.083
BE CHALLENGED.

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:05.485
MY HOPE FOR THESE YOUTH-BASED

00:04:03.216 --> 00:04:07.454
ORGANIZATIONS THAT HELP PREACH

00:04:05.619 --> 00:04:10.223
CHARACTER IS THAT THEY LOOK FOR

00:04:07.587 --> 00:04:11.758
PEOPLE WHO WANT TO BE

00:04:10.357 --> 00:04:13.860
CHALLENGED, AND NOT CURRY FAVOR

00:04:11.892 --> 00:04:15.162
SO MUCH WITH THOSE WHO WANT A

00:04:13.994 --> 00:04:16.263
NICE REASSURING PAT ON THE HEAD.

00:04:15.295 --> 00:04:19.499
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:04:16.663 --> 00:04:19.800
THAT'S HOW THE EPISCOPAL CHURCH

00:04:19.633 --> 00:04:22.836
DIED.

00:04:19.933 --> 00:04:23.103
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:04:22.969 --> 00:04:24.171
WOW.

